Hey, Trainer!{VAR BE01}
Show me your paces!
Give me a whirl!

Hey hey, Trainer!{VAR BE01}
Show me what you can do!
Take me on for a second!

How 'bout that!
Those were some smooth moves, no doubt!{VAR BE01}
But it'd be even tighter if I had a group.{VAR BE01}

The word on the street is...{VAR BE01}
Who's that dancin' in a lonely street?
Who's that dancin' in a port?{VAR BE01}
Who can you meet? Word on the street!{VAR BE01}

Dancers dance!
The audience smiles!{VAR BE00}
Hearts beat with joy!{VAR BE00}
Enough happiness to share!

Thanks, man!
I've got the best team in the world here!{VAR BE00}
That's how I feel.{VAR BE01}

We communicate by dancing.{VAR BE01}
It's how we say happy things,
sad things...{VAR BE00}
How we say the world shines brightly!{VAR BE01}

Landscapes with people...
Landscapes with Pokémon...{VAR BE01}
Each has power and beauty,
compelling me to draw them both.{VAR BE01}
Oh, my studio is down Mode Street a bit.
